@startuml
title OpenIM - Login + API Call Sequence (3.8.3-patch)

autonumber

actor "Client" as C
participant "openim-api\n(HTTP REST)" as API
participant "openim-rpc-auth\n(gRPC)" as Auth
participant "openim-rpc-user\n(gRPC)" as User
database "Redis" as Redis
database "MongoDB" as Mongo

C -> API : POST /login (credentials)
API -> Auth : Authenticate + issue token
Auth -> Redis : Store/refresh session/token state
Redis --> Auth : OK
Auth --> API : JWT/token + userId
API --> C : 200 OK + token

C -> API : GET /user/profile\nAuthorization: Bearer <token>
API -> Auth : Verify token
Auth --> API : OK
API -> User : GetUserInfo(userId)
User -> Mongo : Read user profile
Mongo --> User : user data
User --> API : user data
API --> C : 200 OK + profile

@enduml